<title>SINGAPORE: D.Telekom may seek Singapore listing - paper.</title>
<headline>D.Telekom may seek Singapore listing - paper.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Telecommunications operator Deutsche Telekom may seek a listing in Singapore next year, the Straits Times said on Thursday.</p>
<p>It quoted chief financial officer Joachim Kroske as telling Singapore reporters: &quot;If there is enough demand, we will come to Singapore and other stock exchanges.&quot;</p>
<p>&quot;Let's look at it one year later and then we will decide and take a fast decision,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Trading in Deutsche Telekom shares in Frankfurt, New York and Tokyo is due to begin next month.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom 65-8703080</p>
